{"org":"elastic","repo":"elasticsearch","prNumber":"107414","commit":"496a2448383e0316baf22f3f3605daee2061682f","generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The change to `AggOfLiteralTestCase` introduces new fields (`aggFunctionTemplate`, `replacementForConstant`, `aggSingleValue`) and removes existing ones (`aggFunctionName`, `substitution`). The corresponding changes in `assertAggOfConstExprs` and the test methods (`testAggOfLiteral`, `testAggOfLiteralGrouped`) need to ensure that these new fields are used correctly. Specifically, `replacementForConstant` is now expected to take an `Expression` instead of a class type, which requires verifying that the logic in `assertAggOfConstExprs` aligns with this change.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/optimizer/LogicalPlanOptimizerTests.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/optimizer/LogicalPlanOptimizerTests.java--159449:160936","promptId":"#QHXM6","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/optimizer/LogicalPlanOptimizerTests.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/optimizer/LogicalPlanOptimizerTests.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":159449,"endPos":160936,"startLine":3875,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":3896,"endLineOffset":5,"length":1488}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/optimizer/LogicalPlanOptimizerTests.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/optimizer/LogicalPlanOptimizerTests.java-153318:153323,153359:153644,153655:153670,153681:153696,153707:153722,154173:154188,154201:154227,154241:154279,154292:154349,154362:154450,154463:154506,154519:154581,154594:154643,154656:154699,154712:154774,154787:154836-158046:158331,158351:158369,158438:158451,158478:158497,158524:158543,158570:158589,158617:158715,159380:159427","promptId":"#J7FW2","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/optimi